  "reason": "Existing evidence shows multimodal models (config_016) outperform RNA-only (config_001) but uncertainty remains about multiprofile benefits and aggregation methods. This experiment tests multiprofile with avgpool aggregation (untested in multimodal) using the same pca_n2000+resnet50 encoders and concat fusion. It isolates the impact of multiprofile and aggregation, which are critical design choices with limited prior testing, while building on the established baseline of encoders and fusion strategy."
